{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>He winks, he moves his lips</b> — he speaks." "<b>He gestures</b> — to do evil. It is written ״with his eyes, with his feet״ [meaning] with one of his eyes and with one of his feet. And likewise: ״and he was buried in the cities of Gilead״ — in one of the cities."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:11.055309369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}